# Keep agent/planning docs out of the image. `docs/*` (not `docs`) so
# Vite can still inline docs/MODDING.md into the Extensions tab.
docs/*
!docs/MODDING.md

*.md
!packages/engine/README.md
!mechanics/**/*.md
!docs/MODDING.md

# Authoring-only trees. The Vite build inlines the rest of mechanics/
# (lore, rules, loot, catalogs, playable PCs) — do not exclude that folder.
mechanics/_Backups
mechanics/_Templates

*.log
*.local
